  "instructions": [
    "Heat a tablespoon of oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion, garlic, and grated ginger, sauté until the onion turns translucent.",
    "Stir in the curry powder and cumin, cooking for one minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the chicken pieces and brown them on all sides.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk, water, tamarind paste, and palm sugar, then bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and cook for 15 minutes until the chicken is tender.",
    "Stir in the orange zest and season with salt to taste, letting the flavors meld for five more minutes.",
    "Garnish with fresh cilantro before serving hot over steamed rice."
